v1.3
	deep winter: after a service start / battery-data gap a high SOC is unverified until the
	shunt history or a real (voltage-confirmed) sync confirms it -- never drains on it, resyncs
	with a full charge when shore is present; LowVoltage backstop (12.9 V) forces normal
	charging; cold (< MinChargeTempC) now means <= 0 A into the pack in every state

v1.2
	shore power loss no longer exits storage mode: keeps holding the band on solar only
	(after ShoreLossSeconds); monthly full charge only starts with shore power, a running
	one keeps charging on solar with its timeout paused until shore returns; storage mode
	can be enabled while off shore; status adds "(solar only, no shore power)"

v1.1
	fix: read time-since-full-charge from /Dc/Battery/BatteryService (the monthly full
	charge never triggered); status shows "off" instead of "starting" while idle

v1.0
	initial release: storage SOC band hold via DVCC charge-current trim,
	monthly full charge, shore-loss auto exit, restore of VE.Bus charge limit,
	Settings -> Trailer storage page on the classic GUI
